# sledgehammer - 150bpm, accented four-on-the-floor, no mercy
bpm 150
swing 0
humanize kick 0
humanize hat 0
humanize oh 0
humanize clap 0
humanize snare 0
humanize perc 0
humanize bass 0
humanize stab 0
kick X...X...X...X...
hat x.x.x..x.x.x..x.
filter hat hp 9500
clap ......X.......X.
perc x..x..x..x..x...
tune perc 500
bass g#1 f1 a1 g#1 e1! e2~ c2 d2
filter bass lp 260 res 0.9
sidechain bass 0.85
